WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Balanced eating concerns a pattern across
meals. Start with food you enjoy, can

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
obtain and can prepare.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Foods provide overlapping combinations of
energy and nutrients. A food-group diagram

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
is a teaching tool, not a test of one
meal.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Choose a practical change that fits your
needs. Frozen or tinned options can

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
contribute; a specialist product is not
required by this example.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
General guidance may need adapting for
individual requirements. The Explorer

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
percentage does not assess nutrient intake
or replace appropriate dietary advice.
